   "texts": {
    "Route116_Text_17032A": "Ohhh, what am I to do?\\pWe were on our walk, PEEKO and I, when\\nwe were jumped by an odd thug...\\pThe scoundrel made off with my\\ndarling PEEKO!\\pWrrrooooooaaaar! PEEKO!$"
